{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run/draft && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport json\nsub={\\\"action\\\":\\\"review\\\",\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Resolves the open scope issue ef6b54abce294555b31a3c9a6ca606ac on artifact 05dc6a3632954371911663108e7e18e8 with the evidence acquired since it was raised, namely that the applied-state proposition now exists as its own accepted claim and has been checked and reviewed. The review item records the current judgment for that artifact on its C1 properties.\\\",\n \\\"artifact_id\\\":\\\"05dc6a3632954371911663108e7e18e8\\\",\n \\\"review_items\\\":[{\n  \\\"aspect\\\":\\\"checker_correspondence\\\",\n  \\\"status\\\":\\\"no_issue_found\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"S20-exec\\\",\\\"S23-state-conflict-apply\\\",\\\"S13-handleCommit\\\",\\\"S15-handlePrepareReply\\\",\\\"S14-recovery-start-prepare\\\"],\n  \\\"report_title\\\":\\\"已提交记录不一致的应用层归属已修正\\\",\n  \\\"report_answer\\\":\\\"该工件此前被指出的问题不是观察真假，而是归属：它把应用层一致性断言放在排除执行范围的 C1 义务之下。现在同一观察已由独立义务 C3（范围包含执行该实例）承载并通过复核（工件 52a176de，执行 ef136d1e，结果 violated、复核 no_issue_found），因此该工件的应用层属性不再用于确认 C1；其对 C1 的三条属性（采纳、结果比较、提交广播后一致性）本身对应关系不变。\\\",\n  \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Current judgment for this artifact: its C1 properties (adopted_committed at the resolution, vectors_match between recoverer and committed peer, and all_committed_match after the commit broadcast) encode the accepted C1 obligation and were reviewed as sound in the earlier passes; the applied-state property is the one element that was out of scope, and the question it raised has since been answered by fixing that proposition as its own obligation instead of extending C1, as the issue itself allowed. The observation stands and is now evidence for C3, whose scope includes applying the instance and whose correspondence review found no issue, so nothing in this artifact is being used to confirm C1 beyond its accepted scope, and no C1 result depends on the applied-state property. The limitations that remain are the ones already recorded for the artifact (prepared committed record, direct recovery entry) and they are not affected by this resolution.\\\",\n  \\\"limitations\\\":[\\\"the artifact's fixed bytes still contain the applied-state property; this resolution changes attribution, not the artifact\\\",\n   \\\"the C1 results rest on the artifact's other three properties, which were reviewed in earlier passes and are unchanged here\\\"]}],\n \\\"resolutions\\\":[{\n  \\\"issue_id\\\":\\\"ef6b54abce294555b31a3c9a6ca606ac\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"S20-exec\\\",\\\"S23-state-conflict-apply\\\",\\\"S15-handlePrepareReply\\\"],\n  \\\"evidence_ids\\\":[\\\"52a176deb66c4588a59d71f8afeb13ab\\\",\\\"ef136d1e25924ce59ccedc4fe9e2af2e\\\"],\n  \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The issue asked either to drop the applied-state property from the C1 artifact or to fix the proposition as its own obligation whose scope includes applying the instance. The second path was taken: claim C3-applied-effect-follows-committed-vector now carries the proposition with execution inside its scope and with binding BB4-applied-state (Exec.executeCommand), and its first check (artifact 52a176deb66c4588a59d71f8afeb13ab, execution ef136d1e25924ce59ccedc4fe9e2af2e) asserts the same predicate on the same observation and has been reviewed with no issue found, making C3 confirmed in scope. The applied-state finding is therefore attributed to C3 and is not evidence for C1; C1's own results rest only on its three in-scope properties.\\\",\n  \\\"residual_issue_ids\\\":[],\n  \\\"scope_limitations\\\":[\\\"the disputed artifact keeps its bytes; a reader must treat its applied-state property as belonging to C3\\\",\n    \\\"C3's check carries its own limitations (direct execution instead of the production loop, one instance and key, prepared committed records)\\\"]}]}\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-resolve-issue.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ncd .. && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission submission-resolve-issue.json 2>&1 | head -12\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
